  "review": "<h2 class=\"text-2xl font-bold text-stone-900 border-b-2 border-amber-500 pb-2 mb-4\">人混みを回避して心から癒やされる！2026秋の「静寂な穴場旅」</h2>\n<p class=\"text-xs text-stone-700 leading-relaxed my-2\">有名観光地が大渋滞と大混雑でごった返すシルバーウィーク。「せっかくの休みなのに人混みで疲れてしまった…」とならないために、知る人ぞ知る隠れた名所とゆったり過ごせる温泉地を厳選しました。</p>\n\n<h3 class=\"text-lg font-bold text-stone-900 border-b border-amber-300 pb-1 mt-6 mb-3\">🗺️ エリア別：今からでも間に合う混まない穴場エリア</h3>\n<div class=\"space-y-3 text-xs text-stone-700\">\n  <div class=\"p-3 bg-white rounded-lg border border-amber-100 shadow-sm\">\n    <strong class=\"text-amber-800\">【関東・甲信越の穴場】群馬・四万温泉／長野・戸倉上山田温泉／秩父七湯</strong>\n    <p class=\"mt-1 text-stone-600\">草津や軽井沢のような激しい渋滞がなく、レトロな湯治場情緒と美肌湯を心静かに味わえます。</p>\n  </div>\n  <div class=\"p-3 bg-white rounded-lg border border-amber-100 shadow-sm\">\n    <strong class=\"text-amber-800\">【東北の穴場】岩手・花巻温泉郷台温泉／秋田・湯瀬温泉／山形・赤倉温泉</strong>\n    <p class=\"mt-1 text-stone-600\">新幹線駅からレンタカーで少し奥に入れば、豊かな渓谷美と源泉かけ流しの極上湯が待っています。</p>\n  </div>\n  <div class=\"p-3 bg-white rounded-lg border border-amber-100 shadow-sm\">\n    <strong class=\"text-amber-800\">【西日本の穴場】鳥取・三朝温泉／島根・玉造温泉奥座敷／徳島・祖谷渓谷</strong>\n    <p class=\"mt-1 text-stone-600\">世界屈指のラジウム温泉や秘境の吊り橋など、圧倒的な非日常を混雑なしで満喫可能。</p>\n  </div>\n</div>\n\n<h3 class=\"text-lg font-bold text-stone-900 border-b border-amber-300 pb-1 mt-6 mb-3\">🚅 新幹線＆飛行機セット予約の裏技</h3>\n<p class=\"text-xs text-stone-700 leading-relaxed my-2\">楽天トラベルの「JR楽パック」「JAL/ANA楽パック」なら、連休でも指定席や航空券と宿泊がセットでお得に確保可能。キャンセル規定をチェックしながら直前の空室復活（7日前・3日前）を狙うのも賢いテクニックです。</p>\n\n\n\n<h3 class=\"text-lg font-bold text-stone-900 border-b border-amber-300 pb-1 mt-6 mb-3\">🏨 厳選おすすめ宿泊施設（追加セレクション）</h3>\n<div class=\"space-y-4 my-4\">\n  <div class=\"p-4 bg-white rounded-2xl border border-stone-200 shadow-2xs space-y-2\">\n    <div class=\"flex flex-col md:flex-row gap-3 items-center\">\n      <img src=\"https://img.travel.rakuten.co.jp/share/HOTEL/64792/64792.jpg\" alt=\"高湯温泉　花月ハイランドホテル\" class=\"w-full md:w-36 h-24 object-cover rounded-xl shadow-inner flex-shrink-0\" />\n      <div class=\"flex-grow space-y-1\">\n        <h4 class=\"font-bold text-stone-900 text-sm leading-snug\">高湯温泉　花月ハイランドホテル</h4>\n        <p class=\"text-[11px] text-stone-600\">福島県福島市町庭坂神の森1-20 ｜ ＪＲ　福島駅より車で２５分、福島交通路線バスにて４０分</p>\n        <div class=\"flex items-center gap-3 text-xs text-stone-700\">\n          <span class=\"text-amber-600 font-bold\">⭐ 4.36（1151件）</span>\n          <span class=\"font-bold text-stone-900\">目安: ¥10,000〜</span>\n        </div>\n      </div>\n    </div>\n    <p class=\"text-xs text-stone-700 bg-stone-50 p-2 rounded-lg border border-stone-100\">かけ流しのミルキーブルーな硫黄泉・極上にごり湯からの大自然！夜景と朝日、時には雲海をお愉しみ下さい！</p>\n    <div class=\"text-right pt-1\">\n      <a href=\"https://hb.afl.rakuten.co.jp/hgc/54d2a438.4bc4abc2.54d2a439.aa1be583/?pc=https%3A%2F%2Fhb.afl.rakuten.co.jp%2Fhgc%2F54d2a438.4bc4abc2.54d2a439.aa1be583%2F%3Fpc%3Dhttps%253A%252F%252Fimg.travel.rakuten.co.jp%252Fimage%252Ftr%252Fapi%252Fkw%252FJBe8h%252F%253Ff_no%253D64792\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" class=\"inline-block px-5 py-2 bg-gradient-to-r from-amber-500 to-orange-500 text-white font-bold text-xs rounded-xl shadow hover:opacity-95 transition\">\n        楽天トラベルでプラン・空室を見る ≫\n      </a>\n    </div>\n  </div>\n  <div class=\"p-4 bg-white rounded-2xl border border-stone-200 shadow-2xs space-y-2\">\n    <div class=\"flex flex-col md:flex-row gap-3 items-center\">\n      <img src=\"https://img.travel.rakuten.co.jp/share/HOTEL/38663/38663.jpg\" alt=\"蔵王温泉　堺屋森のホテルヴァルトベルク\" class=\"w-full md:w-36 h-24 object-cover rounded-xl shadow-inner flex-shrink-0\" />\n      <div class=\"flex-grow space-y-1\">\n        <h4 class=\"font-bold text-stone-900 text-sm leading-snug\">蔵王温泉　堺屋森のホテルヴァルトベルク</h4>\n        <p class=\"text-[11px] text-stone-600\">山形県山形市蔵王温泉清水坂889-1 ｜ 山形駅よりバスで蔵王温泉行終点まで約40分。下車徒歩15分／バスターミナル送迎有り（要予約）</p>\n        <div class=\"flex items-center gap-3 text-xs text-stone-700\">\n          <span class=\"text-amber-600 font-bold\">⭐ 4.37（906件）</span>\n          <span class=\"font-bold text-stone-900\">目安: ¥8,250〜</span>\n        </div>\n      </div>\n    </div>\n    <p class=\"text-xs text-stone-700 bg-stone-50 p-2 rounded-lg border border-stone-100\">蔵王の森に囲まれた　愛らしさあふれる宿／大自然の恵み＜湯量豊富な白濁の温泉＞に身をゆだねる至福の時間</p>\n    <div class=\"text-right pt-1\">\n      <a href=\"https://hb.afl.rakuten.co.jp/hgc/54d2a438.4bc4abc2.54d2a439.aa1be583/?pc=https%3A%2F%2Fhb.afl.rakuten.co.jp%2Fhgc%2F54d2a438.4bc4abc2.54d2a439.aa1be583%2F%3Fpc%3Dhttps%253A%252F%252Fimg.travel.rakuten.co.jp%252Fimage%252Ftr%252Fapi%252Fkw%252FJBe8h%252F%253Ff_no%253D38663\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" class=\"inline-block px-5 py-2 bg-gradient-to-r from-amber-500 to-orange-500 text-white font-bold text-xs rounded-xl shadow hover:opacity-95 transition\">\n        楽天トラベルでプラン・空室を見る ≫\n      </a>\n    </div>\n  </div>\n  <div class=\"p-4 bg-white rounded-2xl border border-stone-200 shadow-2xs space-y-2\">\n    <div class=\"flex flex-col md:flex-row gap-3 items-center\">\n      <img src=\"https://img.travel.rakuten.co.jp/share/HOTEL/108117/108117.jpg\" alt=\"飯坂温泉　伊東園ホテル飯坂　叶や\" class=\"w-full md:w-36 h-24 object-cover rounded-xl shadow-inner flex-shrink-0\" />\n      <div class=\"flex-grow space-y-1\">\n        <h4 class=\"font-bold text-stone-900 text-sm leading-snug\">飯坂温泉　伊東園ホテル飯坂　叶や</h4>\n        <p class=\"text-[11px] text-stone-600\">福島県福島市飯坂町湯野字上川原2-4 ｜ 飯坂温泉駅から徒歩で１５分(飯坂温泉駅からの送迎あり。詳しくはホテルまでお問合せください)</p>\n        <div class=\"flex items-center gap-3 text-xs text-stone-700\">\n          <span class=\"text-amber-600 font-bold\">⭐ 3.69（994件）</span>\n          <span class=\"font-bold text-stone-900\">目安: ¥6,248〜</span>\n        </div>\n      </div>\n    </div>\n    <p class=\"text-xs text-stone-700 bg-stone-50 p-2 rounded-lg border border-stone-100\">最寄り駅より徒歩１５分。摺上川や対岸の四季折々の風景を眺めながらゆったりくつろげる大浴場が楽しめます</p>\n    <div class=\"text-right pt-1\">\n      <a href=\"https://hb.afl.rakuten.co.jp/hgc/54d2a438.4bc4abc2.54d2a439.aa1be583/?pc=https%3A%2F%2Fhb.afl.rakuten.co.jp%2Fhgc%2F54d2a438.4bc4abc2.54d2a439.aa1be583%2F%3Fpc%3Dhttps%253A%252F%252Fimg.travel.rakuten.co.jp%252Fimage%252Ftr%252Fapi%252Fkw%252FJBe8h%252F%253Ff_no%253D108117\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" class=\"inline-block px-5 py-2 bg-gradient-to-r from-amber-500 to-orange-500 text-white font-bold text-xs rounded-xl shadow hover:opacity-95 transition\">\n        楽天トラベルでプラン・空室を見る ≫\n      </a>\n    </div>\n  </div>\n  <div class=\"p-4 bg-white rounded-2xl border border-stone-200 shadow-2xs space-y-2\">\n    <div class=\"flex flex-col md:flex-row gap-3 items-center\">\n      <img src=\"https://img.travel.rakuten.co.jp/share/HOTEL/167546/167546.jpg\" alt=\"磐梯熱海温泉　伊東園ホテル磐梯向滝\" class=\"w-full md:w-36 h-24 object-cover rounded-xl shadow-inner flex-shrink-0\" />\n      <div class=\"flex-grow space-y-1\">\n        <h4 class=\"font-bold text-stone-900 text-sm leading-snug\">磐梯熱海温泉　伊東園ホテル磐梯向滝</h4>\n        <p class=\"text-[11px] text-stone-600\">福島県郡山市熱海町熱海5-295 ｜ ＪＲ　磐梯熱海駅よりお車にて約５分</p>\n        <div class=\"flex items-center gap-3 text-xs text-stone-700\">\n          <span class=\"text-amber-600 font-bold\">⭐ 4.08（513件）</span>\n          <span class=\"font-bold text-stone-900\">目安: ¥7,898〜</span>\n        </div>\n      </div>\n    </div>\n    <p class=\"text-xs text-stone-700 bg-stone-50 p-2 rounded-lg border border-stone-100\">磐越三大美人の湯に数えられる源泉をかけ流しにてお楽しみいただけます。</p>\n    <div class=\"text-right pt-1\">\n      <a href=\"https://hb.afl.rakuten.co.jp/hgc/54d2a438.4bc4abc2.54d2a439.aa1be583/?pc=https%3A%2F%2Fhb.afl.rakuten.co.jp%2Fhgc%2F54d2a438.4bc4abc2.54d2a439.aa1be583%2F%3Fpc%3Dhttps%253A%252F%252Fimg.travel.rakuten.co.jp%252Fimage%252Ftr%252Fapi%252Fkw%252FJBe8h%252F%253Ff_no%253D167546\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" class=\"inline-block px-5 py-2 bg-gradient-to-r from-amber-500 to-orange-500 text-white font-bold text-xs rounded-xl shadow hover:opacity-95 transition\">\n        楽天トラベルでプラン・空室を見る ≫\n      </a>\n    </div>\n  </div>\n  <div class=\"p-4 bg-white rounded-2xl border border-stone-200 shadow-2xs space-y-2\">\n    <div class=\"flex flex-col md:flex-row gap-3 items-center\">\n      <img src=\"https://img.travel.rakuten.co.jp/share/HOTEL/32154/32154.jpg\" alt=\"岳温泉　鏡が池碧山亭（伊東園ホテルズ）\" class=\"w-full md:w-36 h-24 object-cover rounded-xl shadow-inner flex-shrink-0\" />\n      <div class=\"flex-grow space-y-1\">\n        <h4 class=\"font-bold text-stone-900 text-sm leading-snug\">岳温泉　鏡が池碧山亭（伊東園ホテルズ）</h4>\n        <p class=\"text-[11px] text-stone-600\">福島県二本松市岳温泉2-13 ｜ 二本松駅(予約制定時無料送迎あり)/二本松ICより10ｋｍ15分</p>\n        <div class=\"flex items-center gap-3 text-xs text-stone-700\">\n          <span class=\"text-amber-600 font-bold\">⭐ 4.23（736件）</span>\n          <span class=\"font-bold text-stone-900\">目安: ¥8,448〜</span>\n        </div>\n      </div>\n    </div>\n    <p class=\"text-xs text-stone-700 bg-stone-50 p-2 rounded-lg border border-stone-100\">日本百名山「安達太良山」を一望する眺めの宿。</p>\n    <div class=\"text-right pt-1\">\n      <a href=\"https://hb.afl.rakuten.co.jp/hgc/54d2a438.4bc4abc2.54d2a439.aa1be583/?pc=https%3A%2F%2Fhb.afl.rakuten.co.jp%2Fhgc%2F54d2a438.4bc4abc2.54d2a439.aa1be583%2F%3Fpc%3Dhttps%253A%252F%252Fimg.travel.rakuten.co.jp%252Fimage%252Ftr%252Fapi%252Fkw%252FJBe8h%252F%253Ff_no%253D32154\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" class=\"inline-block px-5 py-2 bg-gradient-to-r from-amber-500 to-orange-500 text-white font-bold text-xs rounded-xl shadow hover:opacity-95 transition\">\n        楽天トラベルでプラン・空室を見る ≫\n      </a>\n    </div>\n  </div>\n  <div class=\"p-4 bg-white rounded-2xl border border-stone-200 shadow-2xs space-y-2\">\n    <div class=\"flex flex-col md:flex-row gap-3 items-center\">\n      <img src=\"https://img.travel.rakuten.co.jp/share/HOTEL/5743/5743.jpg\" alt=\"鳴子温泉　ホテル亀屋\" class=\"w-full md:w-36 h-24 object-cover rounded-xl shadow-inner flex-shrink-0\" />\n      <div class=\"flex-grow space-y-1\">\n        <h4 class=\"font-bold text-stone-900 text-sm leading-snug\">鳴子温泉　ホテル亀屋</h4>\n        <p class=\"text-[11px] text-stone-600\">宮城県大崎市鳴子温泉車湯54-6 ｜ JR陸羽東線鳴子温泉駅より徒歩15分  駅ご到着時、電話にてお迎えあり。東北自動車道、古川ＩＣよりお車で４０分。</p>\n        <div class=\"flex items-center gap-3 text-xs text-stone-700\">\n          <span class=\"text-amber-600 font-bold\">⭐ 3.81（1141件）</span>\n          <span class=\"font-bold text-stone-900\">目安: ¥7,900〜</span>\n        </div>\n      </div>\n    </div>\n    <p class=\"text-xs text-stone-700 bg-stone-50 p-2 rounded-lg border border-stone-100\">源泉掛け流しの露天風呂と広々とした大浴場、地場の風味を大切にしたお料理をご用意し皆様をお迎えします。</p>\n    <div class=\"text-right pt-1\">\n      <a href=\"https://hb.afl.rakuten.co.jp/hgc/54d2a438.4bc4abc2.54d2a439.aa1be583/?pc=https%3A%2F%2Fhb.afl.rakuten.co.jp%2Fhgc%2F54d2a438.4bc4abc2.54d2a439.aa1be583%2F%3Fpc%3Dhttps%253A%252F%252Fimg.travel.rakuten.co.jp%252Fimage%252Ftr%252Fapi%252Fkw%252FJBe8h%252F%253Ff_no%253D5743\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" class=\"inline-block px-5 py-2 bg-gradient-to-r from-amber-500 to-orange-500 text-white font-bold text-xs rounded-xl shadow hover:opacity-95 transition\">\n        楽天トラベルでプラン・空室を見る ≫\n      </a>\n    </div>\n  </div>\n  <div class=\"p-4 bg-white rounded-2xl border border-stone-200 shadow-2xs space-y-2\">\n    <div class=\"flex flex-col md:flex-row gap-3 items-center\">\n      <img src=\"https://img.travel.rakuten.co.jp/share/HOTEL/2974/2974.jpg\" alt=\"縄文のふる里　大湯温泉　ホテル鹿角\" class=\"w-full md:w-36 h-24 object-cover rounded-xl shadow-inner flex-shrink-0\" />\n      <div class=\"flex-grow space-y-1\">\n        <h4 class=\"font-bold text-stone-900 text-sm leading-snug\">縄文のふる里　大湯温泉　ホテル鹿角</h4>\n        <p class=\"text-[11px] text-stone-600\">秋田県鹿角市十和田大湯字中谷地５－１ ｜ ■十和田湖より車で30分■ＪＲ花輪線十和田南駅から車で１２分■東北道十和田ＩＣから国道１０３号線を十和田湖方面へ１２分</p>\n        <div class=\"flex items-center gap-3 text-xs text-stone-700\">\n          <span class=\"text-amber-600 font-bold\">⭐ 4.18（1499件）</span>\n          <span class=\"font-bold text-stone-900\">目安: ¥6,000〜</span>\n        </div>\n      <